replies.body:
@lmolkova Thanks for the review !
I raised an issue with crewAI team https://github.com/crewAIInc/crewAI/issues/6723 and meanwhile I will be working on other changes mentioned on this PR. 

If they comeback to us on this ...I will co-ordinate accordingly further on the implmentation

@lmolkova Yes, CrewAI’s native telemetry appears to be enabled by default in the current implementation, as seen in https://github.com/venkata-pavani/crewAI/blob/d52d0a162814624095e58116c7bb6f58924e52b2/lib/crewai-core/src/crewai_core/telemetry.py#L123 .

For our instrumentation, we can keep the behavior opt-in and allow users to retain CrewAI’s native telemetry if they choose, while not enabling it by default. 

I will make sure I will pick this up in succeeding PR's while implementing this!
